[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_1]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_1_desc]
The Duchess Hotline is the most direct way for citizens to provide feedback to the Ponyville government. Any suggestions, complaints, or requests for help can be directly contacted by this phone number!
Of course, please do not abuse the Duchess Hotline. All conversations will be recorded, and harassment will be prosecuted!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_1_o0]
Ready to Work

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_2]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_2_desc]
The Red Hotline is an internal hotline used by the Ponyville government, different from the Duchess Hotline —— this phone line is used solely for internal government affairs and is not open to the public.
The phone line is strictly confidential and is only used when it is necessary to report to the Duchess, ordinary grassroots employees will not use it casually.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_2_o0]
Ready to Work

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_3]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_3_desc]
“Hello there, Your Grace! I am a cleaner working near the Everfree Forest. Our job is to clean up the rapidly growing vines.”
“The vines of the Everfree Forest have been growing wildly and are close to getting out of control, which has greatly increased our original cleaning workload. Now a team of three is no longer enough to clean up the vines that grow out every day.”
“I hope Your Grace can hire more cleaners... or should I say... gardeners?”
“We understand that the government’s finances are limited, but even temporary employment would be good.”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_3_o0]
“We will deal with it ASAP”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_3_TOOLTIP]
Unlock §Rtimed§! decison in §YDuchess Office§!: §YMore Gardeners to the Everfree Forest§!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_4]
The Everfree Forest Incident

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_4_desc]
Recently, a caravan from Ponyville to Canterlot was stranded near the Everfree Forest — their cart was entangled by vines growing in the Everfree Forest and could not move forward. After being discovered by nearby ponies, the Ponyville government immediately organized a rescue team to go to the Everfree Forest for rescue.
In the end, the rescue team successfully rescued the caravan, but the caravan’s cargo also suffered heavy losses, with estimated losses of up to tens of thousands of bits. The government stated that it will compensate the caravan, and will also clean up the vines in the Everfree Forest to prevent similar incidents from happening again.
According to reliable sources, two months before the accident, the Duchess of Ponyville had already received warnings from cleaners near the Everfree Forest, but for various reasons, the Ponyville government did not take any action.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_4_o0]
Really unlucky

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_5]
Pontville’s Bureaucracy

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_5_desc]
There is a concerning trend of bureaucracy in Pontville, with the number of government officials nearly tripling compared to the time when Mayor May was in office a few years ago. The government explained that this is because the Pontville government now needs to manage the entire Pontville region rather than just the town of Pontville, so naturally more officials are needed to handle more affairs. However, there is still controversy over whether such a large government institution can really better serve the residents of Pontville. The redundant government institutions undoubtedly put huge pressure on Pontville’s finances, for example, 33 cleaners are employed at a small intersection on the edge of the Everfree Forest!
Since the bureaucracy problem of the Pontville government was exposed, the residents of Pontville have expressed dissatisfaction. A passing merchant pony said in an interview: “I don’t understand why we need so many cleaners. Their salaries are paid by the taxes we work hard to pay, and we don’t see what they contribute to us.”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_5_o0]
Ungrateful Chap!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_6]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_6_desc]
“Ponyville Day Spa, relax your body and mind, purify your soul!”
“Hello, our dear customer! The spa has launched a new promotion recently. As long as you make an appointment within this month, you can enjoy a 20% discount and get three 50% off coupons! Come and make an appointment now!”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_6_o0]
“Ads? This is the Duchess Hotline!”

