[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_15]
Day Spa Scandal

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_15_desc]
Recently, it was reported that Duchess of Ponyville, Trixie, used public funds to book spa services during working hours, causing dissatisfaction among the residents of Ponyville. The Duchess denied the accusation, calling it a smear campaign against her. However, leaked government internal phone call records showed that Trixie did have records of calling the spa. This incident has led to a lack of trust in the government by the residents of Ponyville, and the Duchess’s approval rating has dropped as a result. The Duchess’s office has yet to respond to the matter.
In interviews, some residents said they could understand that the Duchess also needed rest, but dishonest behavior was unacceptable. Moreover, the Duchess’s salary level itself was not low, so it was indeed inappropriate to use public funds to book spa services.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_15_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_15_o1]
Damn! It was a trap!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_16]
Interview with Dr. Hooves

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_16_desc]
Recently, in an interview with Dr. Hooves, a famous scientist in Ponyville, despite giving high praise to the Ponyville government and the Duchess, there seems to be a concern about the lack of support for scientific research in the government.
Dr. Hooves believes that the current government’s approval speed for scientific research project applications is too slow, which has hindered the progress of many scientific research projects, and even caused project interruptions due to insufficient funds. He said that he hopes the government can speed up the approval process so that scientific research projects can proceed more quickly.
Dr. Hooves also said: “Of course, the government is doing well in other aspects. I can also understand that the government has too many affairs to deal with. I just hope that the government can provide more support in scientific research.”
The interview has resonated in the scientific community, and many researchers have expressed their agreement with Dr. Hooves’ remarks, hoping that this issue will be taken seriously not only by the Ponyville government, but also by the Empire government.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_16_o0]
Is it the scientist’s job to be interviewed?

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_17]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_17_desc]
“Your Grace, I am Dr. Hooves.”
“Two months ago, I submitted a new research project application, titled ‘Maximized Efficiency Production Mode Based on Automatic Clock Synchronization Algorithm’, but I have not received any reply so far.”
“If this project is successful, it will help improve the production efficiency of Ponyville and may be further promoted to the entire Equestria. I hope you can help me check it out. Thank you!”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_17_o0]
“We will deal with it ASAP”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_17_TOOLTIP]
Unlock §Rtimed§! decison in §YDuchess Office§!: §YApprove Project: Maximized Efficiency Production Mode Based on Automatic Clock Synchronization Algorithm§!

