[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_20]
Ponyville Explosion Case

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_20_desc]
Just now, a huge explosion occurred in a village near Ponyville. The Ponyville Fire Department has arrived at the scene and is working hard to put out the fire and rescue.
The casualties and causes of the incident are currently unclear. We cannot yet determine whether it is a terrorist attack or just an accident. The Ponyville police have launched an investigation.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_20_o0]
It seems to be Dr. Hooves’ Experiment... Hush it up!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_20_o1]
Sincerely Apologize

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_20_o2]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_21]
Press Conference on Ponyville Explosion Case

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_21_desc]
To address the explosion case a few days ago, the Ponyville government held a formal press conference.
First of all, the cause of the explosion was a scientific research project approved by the Ponyville government, presided over by Dr. Hooves, but due to the out-of-control experiment, it led to the explosion.
The Duchess Trixies first spoke, expressing deep condolences for the event and sincere condolences to the families of the victims. She admitted that the responsibility for the explosion was due to the failure of the Ponyville government to fulfill its supervisory responsibilities, and felt guilty about it.
Next was Dr. Hooves’ speech, however, when it came to the cause of the explosion, Dr. Hooves seemed to be distracted, he was quiet for a full minute without speaking, and then a soft “sorry” and he left the venue directly.
As the project leader and the direct responsible pony for the explosion, Dr. Hooves’ attitude has caused strong dissatisfaction among the media present, but due to the intervention of the Ponyville government, this inappropriate speech has not been widely reported by the media.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_21_o0]
What did he realize?

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_21_TECH_BONUS]
“Ponyville Explosion Case Analysis Report”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_22]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_22_desc]
Evidence suggests that changeling spies have infiltrated Ponyville. Their goal is to gather intelligence on the valley.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_22_o0]
Crack down

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_22_o1]
Ignore

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_23]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_23_desc]
There is evidence that the Changelings in the Ponyville area are forming an organization, but there seems to be no military plot. There is speculation that they seem to be inclined to influence Ponyville’s second election by promoting a candidate through public opinion.
We have not yet obtained a complete list of the undercover members of the Changelings, but we have obtained the code name used by the Changeling organization in Ponyville —— “Fluffle Puff Doll”.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_23_o0]
Crack down

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_23_o1]
Ignore

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_24]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_24_desc]
“Hello! This is Ponyville Plush Toy Company. Is this the “Fluffle Puff Doll” you ordered? Let me check the delivery address... It will be delivered to the alley next to the Sugar Cube Corner at 10:30 p.m. two days later. Is that correct?”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_24_o0]
“Wrong number?”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_24_o1]
(Wait, that’s the code...)

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_25]
First Encounter

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_25_desc]
According to the time and place described in the phone call, Trixie disguised herself as an ordinary resident of Ponyville and waited for the contact.
Under the moonlight, a dark figure appeared at the end of the alley. After looking around vigilantly, he hurriedly put down a package and left. When Trixie caught up, the pony had disappeared into the night.
Trixie did not choose to open the package, but hurriedly brought it back to her carriage. When she returned to the carriage, pulled up the curtains and turned off the lights, she opened the package in the dark——
It turned out to be really just a plush toy.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_25_o0]
Huh?

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_26]
Second Thought

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_26_desc]
The second day, Trixie suddenly realized something, cut open the plush toy with a knife, and found a note inside.
“Hello, Duchess! You have tacitly approved the activities of the Changelings in Ponyville, indicating your willingness to cooperate with us. We do want to intervene in the second Ponyville election, but our intervention goal is to help you win.”
“We have discovered that you are not getting along with Empress Cozy Glow. Please rest assured that we will protect you. In exchange, we hope that you, after being elected, can exert influence on the economy and foreign policy of the Equestria Empire in the future to support the interests of the Changelings. Ponyville’s position in the Empire is very influential.”
“But I think we need to establish trust between us first. As a manifestation of sincerity, from today, the Ponyville Plush Toy Company will donate part of its profits to Ponyville for free logs, helping you get through the upcoming winter.”
“If you don’t trust us, you can seal the Ponyville Plush Toy Company at any time; but if you trust us, then the first step, please inadvertently imply that Filthy Rich has accepted bribes in next week’s media interview.”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_26_o0]
Interesting

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_27]
Plush Toy Scandal

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_27_desc]
Recently, in an interview, Trixie accidentally revealed that the Ponyville government is investigating Filthy Rich for bribery, causing widespread concern.
Although Trixie did not give any official response, Ponyville reporters quickly found a company called “Ponyville Plush Toy Company” - a shredded transfer slip was found in its trash can, and the payee on it was Filthy Rich.
Filthy Rich said he was unaware of the matter, while the “Ponyville Plush Toy Company” did not respond, but quickly paid a fine and hoped to settle the matter as soon as possible.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_27_o0]
Interesting

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_28]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_28_desc]
“Ahh, Trixie, I’m the Empress. I heard that Ponyville is having a hard time this winter? It just so happens that the Empire’s finance and energy ministry was fooled into buying a lot of low-qua... uh... a lot of fuel recently, and we can’t use it.”
“Consider it a favor from the Empire to the Duchy. We will give you the fuel to help you through the winter. No need to say thank you or refuse it, that’s how generous the Empress of Friendship is.”
“What? I didn’t hear you clearly, you said you don’t need fuel? And winter is almost over? Oh, I see, you must be unwilling to take advantage of the Empire for nothing, and your conscience can’t bear it.”
“I understand. The Empire thanks you for your loyalty. How about this, you just pay a little, symbolic, for your conscience. Not too much, how about 95% of the Empire’s purchase price?”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_28_o0]
“Yes, Your Majesty!” (gritting teeth)

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_29]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_29_desc]
“Ahh, Trixie, I’m the Empress. The issue you reported about excessive fuel storage has been understood. How about this, the Empire will send a team of engineers to help you build fuel silos for free?”
“We plan to build 17 fuel silos in Ponyville, which you don’ need to pay for. Just view it as a favor from the Empire. You only need to prepare the construction materials, and then provide food, insurance, and wages for the workers and engineers.”
“Oh, by the way, although you don’t need to pay for the construction, you still need to remember to pay the construction tax, as a loyal citizen and Duchess of the Empire, right?”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_29_o0]
“Yes, Your Majesty!” (gritting teeth)

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_29_o1]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_30]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_30_desc]
“Your Grace! I am the Chief Consultant of the fire safety expert group of Ponyville. After a preliminary assessment, our safety report concludes that there are huge fire hazards in the large number of fuel silos you have recently built in Ponyville.”
“For the sake of avoiding unnecessary public panic, we have not made this report public. However, we strongly recommend that you take immediate action to conduct routine fire inspections on the fuel silos, or dismantle most of the fuel silos.”
“Please take this issue seriously to avoid irreparable disasters.”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_30_o0]
“I didn’t want to build them either...”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_30_TOOLTIP]
Unlock §Rtimed§! decison in §YDuchess Office§!: §YFuel Silo Fire Safety Assessment Special Team§!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_31]
Iron Monstrosities

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_31_desc]
After receiving the call, Duchess Trixie immediately attended the next Ponyville fire safety meeting. At the meeting, Trixie listened to the analysis of the experts and decided to set up a special team to evaluate the safety of the fuel silos.
However, it is obvious that these iron monstrosities standing in Ponyville and the surrounding areas have brought great pressure to the Ponyville government and fire department, and it is not easy to solve this problem in a short time. The fuel quality from the Empire in the fuel silos is also very poor, which makes Trixie even more anxious.
Just as the meeting was about to end, the door of the meeting room was suddenly knocked.
“Who’s there?”
A pony with a hat cautiously poked his head in, followed by a second one.
“Flim and Flam? You are government employees of Ponyville, are you? What are you doing in the town hall meeting room!” Trixie immediately showed a disgusted expression when she saw the twins.
“No... but... oh, right. Ahem! As the Minister of Industry of Equestria Empire, I came to visit the industrial construction of the territory. Is there anything wrong with that?” Flim immediately found an excuse.
Although Trixie didn’t know how to refute for a while, she still decided to drive the two “irrelevants” out.
“Wait, wait... don’t be in such a hurry! In the corridor just now, we thought we ‘accidentally’ heard the topic of fire safety being discussedand. What a coincidence! Would you like to know more about our ‘Super Safe Fire Extingui...”
“No! Get out!”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_31_o0]
(Unfortunately, Trixie eventually placed the order)

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_32]
90 Seconds to Death!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_32_desc]
Do you know? In a closed building, it only takes 90 seconds for a fire to take the lives of ponies! Fire is a terrible disaster that can cause huge damage in a short time. Therefore, it is important to prevent fires and eliminate potential safety hazards.
However, the Ponyville government has done almost nothing to prevent fires! According to internal sources from the fire department, the Duchess has never participated in any meetings of the fire department, nor has there been any plans for fire prevention. This is a irresponsible attitude towards the lives of ponies!
If it were just a passive attitude, it would be fine, but the Ponyville government is actually actively creating new fire hazards! A leaked internal report shows that the fire department has repeatedly warned the city government and the Duchess herself that building a large number of fuel silos in Ponyville would pose a huge threat to fire safety. However, the city government and the Duchess have ignored the warnings and continued to build fuel silos.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_32_o0]
Who tf made this flyer?

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_33]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_33_desc]
“Hello, Your Grace! We are a perfume company and we would like to invite Miss Octavia to endorse our company and shoot some advertisements.”
“We understand that the government of Ponyville has certain restrictions on government officials participating in commercial activities, but we hope you can help us solve some administrative problems.”
“If possible, we will provide you with generous rewards... Oh, please don’t get me wrong, we will openly donate to the government of Ponyville for public welfare as a token of appreciation.”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_33_o0]
“We will deal with it ASAP”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_33_TOOLTIP]
