Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_35_desc]
“Your Grace, I am Dr. Hooves.”
“Two months ago, I submitted a new research project application, titled ‘Rabid Rhododendrons Neutralizer’, but I have not received any reply so far.”
“If this project is successful, it will help clean up the vines and other plants that are growing wildly in the Everfree Forest, reducing the pressure on the gardeners. I hope you can help me check it out. Thank you!”

