[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_36]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_36_desc]
“Hey, Trixie, this is the Empress, I have a relative who wants to work at the Ponyville Post Office recently, arrange it, got it?”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_36_o0]
“We will deal with it ASAP”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_36_TOOLTIP]
Unlock §Rtimed§! decison in §YDuchess Office§!: §YThe Nepotism Dilemma§!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_37]
Nepotism

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_37_desc]
Recently, there was a news leak that Spoiled Rich, the wife of Filthy Rich, also entered the Ponyville government, which caused the public to have a sense of distrust in the Ponyville government. An internal employee said that the Ponyville government has a serious nepotism problem, which may lead to the government’s unfair behavior.
In response to this, the Ponyville Office immediately responded that it will investigate the matter to ensure the fairness of the government. Ponyville government will crack down on nepotism and maintain the credibility of the government.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_37_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_38]
Post Office Infiltration Completed

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_38_desc]
Great! Ponyville has completed our mission, and our agent have successfully infiltrated the Ponyville Post Office. We can start collecting information at any time.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_38_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_39]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_39_desc]
“Hello, this is the Duchess Hotline. How may I assist——”
“ITS ME! TRIXIE! YOU CAN'T EVEN RECOGNIZE THE EMPRESS?” The furious voice of Queen Cozy Glow came from the other end of the line, startling Trixie.
“Y-yes... Your Majesty. It’s the fault of the great and powerful Trixie. What can I do for you, Your Majesty?”

The yelling on the other end grew louder: “You don’t know? Just look at what your little bureaucrat has done! What kind of music festival is hers? I attended the music festival myself, and you tell me that is the theme of ‘Peace and Harmony’?! The entire concert was praising the magic of friendship! And look at her psycho partner, those loud music beats, and all their music titles are about their past good times and love stories! Not a single song mentioned me! Not a single song praised the ‘Jahr Null’! What is the meaning of this in Ponyville? I guess you don’t want to keep your duchy anymore!”
Trixie finally understood, but the music festival had already passed for a week. She could only try to soothe the Empress’s emotions: “Your Majesty, this is all Trixie’s fault. Trixie will correct everything, and next time, we will hold a music festival with the theme of ‘The Great and Powerful Empress’, I guarantee that you will be satisfied!”
“Is that the key point? Those ponies were playing music and almost transformed during the performance. If I don’t pay attention, you crazy ponies might even shoot rainbow lasers at the concert! I have decided to issue a Music Ban and confiscate all instruments and records! From now on, Ponyville must strictly enforce this ban, or your duchy will be gone! Goodbye!”
The phone was hung up abruptly.

Trixie slumped in her chair, looking around to make sure there were no ponies around before muttering under her breath: “What a kid with a bad temper!” Then she opened the drawer and took out a photo of the former famous musician in Ponyville, who is now also a Ponyville bureaucrat, murmuring to herself: “Octavia, come on, Octavia, why are you so stubborn? All your musics are instrumental, why don’t you just change the name of the songs... You don’t even need to change a single note. Now, I have to clean up your mess! Sigh!”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_39_o0]
“We will deal with it ASAP”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_39_TOOLTIP]
Unlock §Rtimed§! decison in §YDuchess Office§!: §YImplement Music Ban§!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_40]
Percussion

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_40_desc]
Inside the Ponyville Music Theater, the new symphony concert of the Octavia Orchestra is about to begin. Although after Jahr Null, Ponyville, or rather, entire atmosphere of Ponyville, has become unusually eerie and desolate. But the Summer Music Festival has clearly brought a glimmer of hope and vitality back to Ponyville. Since then, more and more ponies have participated in various music activities, and the number of performances and ticket sales of the Octavia Orchestra has gradually increased. Today, because of the arrival of the new symphony, ponies are flocking to the scene, this is one of their few moments of joy. “Have you heard? This time the new symphony was composed by Octavia herself!” “Really? It must be great!” “I heard it’s very creative, it will start with percussion.” “Looking forward to it!”
On the stage, the orchestra has taken their seats, and the focus of the entire scene, Octavia, walks to the center of the stage to greet the audience. Ceremoniously, Octavia gave her score sheet to the conductor, then walked to the cellist’s position. The instruments began to tune, and the audience quieted down, waiting for the music to begin. By the time the music was about to start, the whole scene was silent, so quiet that even the sound of hay falling to the ground could be heard.

First, two light xylophone notes, then the timpanist raised the drumstick high. “Bang!”
It wasn’t the sound of the timpani, but the sound of the theater door being kicked open. A group of fully armed riot police stormed into the theater, surrounding the entire scene. The scene was in chaos, many ponies tried to escape, but were intercepted by the riot police, and the conductor was arrested.
“Quiet!” Trixie appeared on the stage, and behind her was a Canterlot commissioner who was more oppressive than Trixie, he was here to supervise Trixie in implementing the Music Ban. Trixie looked at the trembling conductor, waved her hoof to the police: “Let him go. He has no chance to commit a crime now.” The police did as they were told.

Trixie touched her tie: “Hello, everypony! I’m sorry to interrupt your excitement. The great and powerful Trixie knows that today is an important day for you and Ms. Octavia...”
She paused, her tone became heavier: “But, the law is the law! According to the Music Ban issued by Her Majesty, all large music gatherings are clearly prohibited. So, I’m sorry, today’s symphony concert has been forced to cancel. In view of the fact that the conductor and Ms. Octavia are both first-time lawbreakers, I will be lenient, but I must confiscate all musical instruments. If this were to happen again, I will arrest all of you!” Trixie turned to the ponies in the orchestra and said: “Now, go back to the police station with us for questioning.”
Trixie acted very fiercely, but she was actually trembling herself — she knew that this action would cause dissatisfaction among the ponies, but she also knew that the Empress’s orders were not to be violated, especially with a commissioner present to monitor her.

When Trixie came down from the stage, she heard a curse from the audience: “Why do you do this to us? Duchess Trixie!” Trixie could not answer, she did not even dare to look back, and hurriedly left the theater.

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_40_o0]
Indeed, started with percussion, just too short

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_41]
Deinstrumentalization

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_41_desc]
“No please, officer! Don’t destroy my beloved cornet!” A pony with a beret hat was kneeling in front of a police officer, begging desperately. But the officer, with a blank expression, placed the cornet on the workbench in front of the pony, then raised a large hammer and smashed it down hard on the cornet. With that blow, it wasn’t just the delicate cornet that was destroyed, but also the passionate heart of the cornet player for music. He slumped to the ground, looking at everything helplessly.
Meanwhile, two fully armed riot police were struggling to lift a piano, and an earth pony police officer was trying to break free from a mare’s “harassment”. The mare was holding the earth pony police officer’s hoof, pleading: “Don’t do this, this piano is the only relic my father left me, it’s my only memory of him, plese don’t take it away!”
“This is the order issued by the great and benevolent Empress, from now on, no pony is allowed to hold musical instruments in their homes. If you dare to play music on the street, it is a more serious crime, and you can be executed directly!” The police officer shouted at the mare while kicking her with his hoof. Even though the mare was beaten all over, she still refused to let go of her hoof: “Then kill me with it! If I can’t protect it, what’s the point of me being alive!”
“Your wish is granted!” The police officer took out a metal baton and was about to smash it down on the mare’s head...

“Stop!” A blue magical beam grabbed the baton held by the police officer, preventing him from committing the crime. The police officers turned around and saw that it was Trixie! The police officers bowed to her. Trixie was dressed very formally, and behind her was again the commissioner sent from Canterlot.
Seeing the mare lying on the ground and gasping for breath in pain, Trixie waved her hoof, and two bodyguards separated the mare from the police officer. Then, Trixie pointed at the police officer and said: “You are suspended!”.
Just as the commissioner behind Trixie was about to show an unhappy expression, Trixie immediately coughed twice, walked to the police officer, and said with an intentionally loud voice: “If you need to use violence to execute the simple and wise order of the Empress, it means that you are not capable of doing your job. This is the reason why you are suspended, understand?”
Seeing the commissioner’s expression soften but still staring at the piano seriously, Trixie immediately understood. She had no choice but to shoot a magical beam, turning the piano into a pile of scrap metal in an instant. “See? It only took a few seconds!” Trixie said to the police officer. Only then did the commissioner nod in satisfaction and leave.

Trixie looked at the mare whose eyes shimmering with tears, and oredered to detain this mare. “Keep an eye on her!”
“Understood, I promise to monitor her strictly! I won’t let her secretly make instruments or hide records in prison!” A new police officer immediately promised.
Trixie angrily kicked him: “Idiot! I mean keep an eye on her, don’t let her commit suicide!”

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_41_o0]
What have I done...

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_43]
Ring —— Ring —— !

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_43_desc]
Trixie is anxiously waiting for incoming information. The Empire’s commissioner has locked Trixie in the office, forbidding her to do anything else — not even allowing her to go out for lunch to eat hay burgers.
Trixie sometimes stares at the phone, sometimes looks out the window. She doesn’t know when the information will come, or in what way it will come. She only knows that the clock is ticking.

“Ponyville Day Spa, relax your body and mind, purify your soul!”
“Hello, our dear customer! —”

Trixie angrily hangs up the phone. The Ponyville Day Spa dare to make a junk call at this emergency moment!
Wait a minute... that voice... why is it so familiar?!

[en.EVENT_C02_HOTLINE_43_o0]
The commissioner listens to the phone call, feeling nothing wrong

